<title>UK: Bodycote up on acquisition plans, H1 profits.</title>
<headline>Bodycote up on acquisition plans, H1 profits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Bodycote International jumped to a new record peak after the company said it planned to acquire Swedish heat treatment group Brukens Thermotreat AB, dealers said.  nL07273638.</p>
<p>AT 0859 GMT, the shares were up 26-1/2p, or about 3.75 percent, to 737-1/2p. They traded as high as 739p.</p>
<p>Also fuelling the gains were strong results for the first half, they said.</p>
<p>Bodycote posted a 44 percent increase in pre-tax profits to 12.44 million stg in the six months ended June 30 from 8.68 million stg in the year earlier period.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
